config BR2_PACKAGE_MODEM_SETUP
	bool "modem-setup"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_MODEM_MANAGER
	help
	  Modem setup for the Fairphone 2 and 3: before ModemManager,
	  prefer LTE and set the LTE attach APN from the NetworkManager
	  GSM connection; once registered on 2G or 3G, move to LTE once.
	  The same scripts as the citronics-lime-fp2/fp3 Debian packages.
